<p id=3D"A1.SS7.p1.1" class=3D"ltx_p">We use a simple prompt template to co=
nstruct our experiment prompts. The task descriptions are one-line minimal =
descriptions as shown in Appendix&nbsp;<a href=3D"https://arxiv.org/html/25=
05.13360v3#A1.SS1" title=3D"A.1 Task descriptions =E2=80=A3 Appendix A Deta=
ils on Experiments Setups =E2=80=A3 What Prompts Don=E2=80=99t Say: Underst=
anding and Managing Underspecification in LLM Prompts" class=3D"ltx_ref"><s=
pan class=3D"ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">A.1</span></a>.</p>
</div>
